==Post-match==
After the match Prime Minister of Greece [[Kyriakos Mitsotakis]] made a post on social media platform [[Twitter|X]], describing Olympiacos as "a true legend". This win caused a big celebration with several thousand Olympiacos fans gathered in [[Piraeus]], Greece.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.reuters.com/sports/soccer/passionate-olympiakos-fans-celebrate-historic-victory-2024-05-29/|title=Passionate Olympiakos fans celebrate historic victory|date=30 May 2024|work=Reuters|accessdate=30 May 2024}}</ref>

